{"id":"cb919cd5fffb","publishedAt":1793966640000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"味噌汁の具で一番のハズレ、これしかない"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-category-43.html","text":"食べ物・グルメ"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/06"},{"text":"12:04"},{"text":"1"},{"text":"-"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":"スポンサーリンク"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" \nスポンサーリンク \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":"あおさ"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nかぼちゃ \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":"ほかの具とも相性悪い "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" あおさのみだと実質具無し"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nワイ的にはお揚げはいらん "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" パッサパサでまずい \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>4"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" 油揚げパサパサは保存方法が悪いだけや"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>7"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" 揚げ足とるなよ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" なんつって? \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>9"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" 最悪や"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>4"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" どんな作り方してんねん。味噌汁でパサパサの油揚げなんて見たことないわ。 \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nじゃがいも \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>5"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" 小さく切って入れたらほくほくでうまいよ \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nわかめ \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \n玉葱 \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nワイは豆腐でねぎさえ入ってりゃ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" 他にはなにもいらない \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nジャガイモ+青葱は好き \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nマイナーな具材は論外ですよ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" メジャーな具材でお願いします \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \n大根は他だとう～ん?やが "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" 味噌汁にしたらうまい \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \nまぁ麩やな "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" あれを喜んでる人類はいないわ \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>20"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" 麸は今日の具材に迷ったら入れとけ枠"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>20"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" 麩か、油揚げよりは麩かなワイは \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":"ちな最強は卵な "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" にらたまは殿堂入り"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>23"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" にらたまになったらそれ味噌汁やないやんもう \n"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>25"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"#cc0000","text":" にらたまの味噌汁やぞ"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"#0000ff","text":">>1"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"text":" は？ジャガイモな?? \n"}],[{"bold":true,"text":" \n卵は鶏ガラスープの方にいれちゃうわ \n"},{"br":1},{"color":"#808080","size":12,"text":"引用元："},{"color":"#808080","size":12,"text":"http://hayabusa.open2ch.net/test/read.cgi/livejupiter/1793754241"},{"br":1},{"text":"関連記事"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80256.html?sp","text":"\n かぼちゃがメインの料理、すべからくまずい "},{"br":1},{"text":"\n 味噌汁の具で一番のハズレ、これしかない "},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80251.html?sp","text":"\n 人生で食べたことない食べ物あげてけ "},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80248.html?sp","text":"\n おでん「魚の練り物や野菜だけの優しい世界だよ」さつま揚げ「わーい」つみれ「楽しい～」 "},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80247.html?sp","text":"\n 好きなうどんの具何や？ "},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80244.html?sp","text":"\n でも唐揚げ出しとけば満足するじゃんお前ら "},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80253.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80253.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80253.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"http://nantuka.blog119.fc2.com/blog-entry-80253.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(1)"},{"br":1},{"text":"TB"},{"br":1},{"text":"(-)"}]],"comments":[]}